  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study Visit students CoCreate My City Upcycle circular economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This visit continues the #cocreateMYCITY Johannesburg 2021, South Africa, which aims to create more (circular) economic opportunities for local entrepreneurs in South Africa and focuses on South African students to develop their innovation and entrepreneurial skills.Also, the visit focuses on strengthening start-up platforms at South African universities to support young entrepreneurs.For the longer term, there is a focus on adapting curricula at South African universities to include business skills and innovations.</narrative>
  </description>
